{"4621600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LEGION OF HONOR", "steam_appid": 4621600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Behind enemy lines, history isn’t written — it's reclaimed by those who fight for it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>LEGION OF HONOR</strong>, you fight across occupied Europe as resistance operatives striking where armies cannot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven WWII missions across multiple countries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punchy and reactive combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-player co-op (split-screen &amp; online)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: up to 4 players locally or online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly mix splitscreen with online players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic objective-based mission structure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized WWII action</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic World War Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a wide arsenal of WWII weaponry — rifles, SMGs, pistols, and improvised explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon is powerful, punchy, and satisfying to use, with a stylized identity inspired by real history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621600/extras/f1bfd29b5045e60cefc8efd62b649b94.avif?t=1784906352\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat &amp; Player Freedom</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies react to your presence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They investigate sounds, call for reinforcements, take cover and throw back grenades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some push forward. Others hold the line.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge in with heavy firepower, or take your time and pick your shots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammo is plentiful but mistakes could still cost you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some missions reward stealth, others reward chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your approach is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visual Style and Tone</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized environments built on classic PSX-era rendering techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean, readable look with a grounded, nostalgic feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An orchestral score that complements the experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621600/extras/1f1bff77ef4c4cd5092fbf317af40196.avif?t=1784906352\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Behind enemy lines, history isn’t written — it's reclaimed by those who fight for it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>LEGION OF HONOR</strong>, you fight across occupied Europe as resistance operatives striking where armies cannot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven WWII missions across multiple countries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punchy and reactive combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-player co-op (split-screen &amp; online)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer: up to 4 players locally or online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly mix splitscreen with online players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic objective-based mission structure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized WWII action</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic World War Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a wide arsenal of WWII weaponry — rifles, SMGs, pistols, and improvised explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon is powerful, punchy, and satisfying to use, with a stylized identity inspired by real history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621600/extras/f1bfd29b5045e60cefc8efd62b649b94.avif?t=1784906352\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat &amp; Player Freedom</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies react to your presence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They investigate sounds, call for reinforcements, take cover and throw back grenades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some push forward. Others hold the line.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge in with heavy firepower, or take your time and pick your shots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ammo is plentiful but mistakes could still cost you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some missions reward stealth, others reward chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your approach is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visual Style and Tone</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized environments built on classic PSX-era rendering techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean, readable look with a grounded, nostalgic feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An orchestral score that complements the experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621600/extras/1f1bff77ef4c4cd5092fbf317af40196.avif?t=1784906352\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A WWII action-adventure FPS with powerful gunplay. Fight through operations across occupied Europe, blending fast-paced combat with the spirit of classic war stories! Featuring Splitscreen and Online Multiplayer modes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621600/71ba57e97ff2b3db1ebd6dc60bd31978c01fc3b3/header.jpg?t=1784906352", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621600/bacdeaa4759fd1dab444198f428a6f8a9ff49c13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784906352", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4621600/bacdeaa4759fd1dab444198f428a6f8a9ff49c13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784906352", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600K / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements":